thub&utm_medium=check&utm_content=benchmark)\n> - [`` lazy_traversal[1] ``](https://app.codspeed.io/jonathanong/no-mistakes/branches/fix%2F2076-parameter-annotation-cache?uri=crates%2Fno-mistakes%2Fbenches%2Fcore_analysis.rs%3A%3Abenches%3A%3Abench_lazy_traversal%3A%3Alazy_traversal%255B1%255D&runnerMode=Simulation&utm_source=github&utm_medium=check&utm_content=benchmark)\n> - [`` observer_overhead[verbose] ``](https://app.codspeed.io/jonathanong/no-mistakes/branches/fix%2F2076-parameter-annotation-cache?uri=crates%2Fno-mistakes%2Fbenches%2Fcore_analysis.rs%3A%3Abenches%3A%3Abench_observer_overhead%3A%3Aobserver_overhead%255Bverbose%255D&runnerMode=Simulation&utm_source=github&utm_medium=check&utm_content=benchmark)\n> - …and 29 more\n\n</details>\n\n`⚡ 1` improved benchmark  \n`❌ 1` regressed benchmark  \n`✅ 221` untouched benchmarks  \n`⏩ 4` skipped benchmarks[^skipped]  \n\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> Please fix the performance issues or [acknowledge them on CodSpeed](https://app.codspeed.io/jonathanong/no-mistakes/branches/fix%2F2076-parameter-annotation-cache?q=is%3Aregression&utm_source=github&utm_medium=check&utm_content=acknowledge).\n\n### Performance Changes\n\n|     | Mode | Benchmark | `BASE` | `HEAD` | Efficiency |\n| --- | ---- | --------- | ------ | ------ | ---------- |\n| ❌ | Memory | [`` extract_after_recorded_prefix ``](https://app.codspeed.io/jonathanong/no-mistakes/branches/fix%2F2076-parameter-annotation-cache?uri=crates%2Fno-mistakes%2Fbenches%2Fcore_analysis.rs%3A%3Abenches%3A%3Abench_language_frontends%3A%3Alanguage_frontend_lifecycle%3A%3Aextract_after_recorded_prefix&runnerMode=Memory&utm_source=github&utm_medium=check&utm_content=benchmark) | 346 KB | 811.7 KB | -57.37% |\n| ⚡ [:warning:](https://codspeed.io/docs/instruments/cpu?utm_source=github&utm_medium=check&utm_content=significant_sys_time#system-calls \"System calls are not included in the measure\") | Simulation | [`` extract ``](https://app.codspeed.io/jonathanong/no-mistakes/branches/fix%2F2076-parameter-annotation-cache?uri=crates%2Fno-mistakes%2Fbenches%2Fcore_analysis.rs%3A%3Abenches%3A%3Abench_language_frontends%3A%3Alanguage_frontends%3A%3Aextract&runnerMode=Simulation&utm_source=github&utm_medium=check&utm_content=benchmark) | 25.4 ms | 16.7 ms | +51.83% |\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Investigate this regression by commenting `@codspeedbot fix this regression` on this PR, or directly use the [CodSpeed MCP](https://codspeed.io/docs/ai/mcp?utm_source=github&utm_medium=check&utm_content=mcp_tip_regression) with your agent.\n\n---\n\n<sub>Comparing <code>fix/2076-parameter-annotation-cache</code> (099cfed) with <code>main</code> (b947693)</sub>\n\n<a href=\"https://app.codspeed.io/jonathanong/no-mistakes/branches/fix%2F2076-parameter-annotation-cache?utm_source=github&utm_medium=check&utm_content=button\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://codspeed.io/pr-report/open-in-codspeed-dark.svg\">\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://codspeed.io/pr-report/open-in-codspeed-light.svg\">\n    <img alt=\"Open in CodSpeed\" src=\"https://codspeed.io/pr-report/open-in-codspeed-light.svg\" width=\"169\" height=\"32\">\n  </picture>\n</a>\n\n\n[^skipped]: 4 benchmarks were skipped, so the baseline results were used instead. If they were deleted from the codebase, [click here and archive them to remove them from the performance reports](https://app.codspeed.io/jonathanong/no-mistakes/branches/fix%2F2076-parameter-annotation-cache?q=is%3Askipped&utm_source=github&utm_medium=check&utm_content=archive).\n","text":null,"annotations_count":0,"annotations_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonathanong/no-mistakes/check-runs/117114235675/annotations"},"check_suite":{"id":105535424088},"app":{"id":257293,"client_id":"Iv1.e7febeb3870a36fb","slug":"codspeed","node_id":"A_kwHOBvQP3M4AA-0N","owner":{"login":"CodSpeedHQ","id":116658140,"node_id":"O_kgDOBvQP3A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116658140?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodSpeedHQ","html_url":"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodSpeedHQ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodSpeedHQ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodSpeedHQ/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodSpeedHQ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodSpeedHQ/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodSpeedHQ/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodSpeedHQ/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodSpeedHQ/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CodSpeedHQ/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"CodSpeed","description":"## What is [CodSpeed](https://codspeed.io)?\r\nCodSpeed is a **continuous benchmarking** platform that allows you to **track** and **compare** the **performance** of your codebase during development.\r\n\r\nIt uses a smart **runtime engine** to measure the performance of your code in an **accurate** and **reproducible** way without creating a huge **runtime overhead**, unlike traditional benchmarks.\r\n\r\nCodSpeed produces detailed **performance reports** helping you **improve** your codebase **performance**, directly **within your repository provider** (Pull Requests comments, Merge checks, ...).\r\n\r\n## How it works\r\n\r\nThe core of the **performance measurement** is done directly within your **CI environment** through the **CodSpeed Action**. Allowing you to **stay the sole owner** of your data and to keep your **codebase private**.\r\n\r\nOnce the performance data is generated, **only the benchmark results** are sent to the CodSpeed servers to be **analyzed**.\r\n\r\nThen, performance reports are **generated** and **published** directly **within your repository provider**.\r\n\r\n## How long does it take to install?\r\n\r\nIf you're **already benchmarking** your codebase, you can plug your **existing benchmarks** to CodSpeed in **less than 5 minutes** since CodSpeed benchmark's API is **compatible** with the most **popular benchmarking frameworks**.\r\n\r\nIf **you haven't any benchmarks yet**, we provide an **intuitive** benchmarking API that allows you to **create your first benchmarks** in a **few minutes**.\r\n","external_url":"https://codspeed.io","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/codspeed","created_at":"2022-11-02T17:17:13Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T12:58:24Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"write","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","members":"read","metadata":"read","organization_self_hosted_runners":"write","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["issue_comment","organization","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","push","repository","workflow_job","workflow_run"]},"pull_requests":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonathanong/no-mistakes/pulls/2086","id":4891655287,"number":2086,"head":{"ref":"fix/2076-parameter-annotation-cache","sha":"099cfed26a23050aee6e9e8427af4de9b7eab4ef","repo":{"id":1235521884,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonathanong/no-mistakes","name":"no-mistakes"}},"base":{"ref":"main","sha":"b9476931aeecc3e24f43a276bf1c6a2088bebe3b","repo":{"id":1235521884,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonathanong/no-mistakes","name":"no-mistakes"}}}]},{"id":117113733730,"name":"Benchmarks","node_id":"CR_kwDOSaSRXM8AAAAbRIXCYg","head_sha":"099cfed26a23050aee6e9e8427af4de9b7eab4ef","external_id":"c6a858cc-2d66-55a8-a1d1-d965f5a0195c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jonathanong/no-mistakes/check-runs/117113733730","html_url":"https://github.com/jonathanong/no-mistakes/actions/runs/38941195465/job/117113733730","details_url":"https://github.com/jonathanong/no-mistakes/actions/runs/38941195465/job/117113733730","status":"completed","conclusion"